## 📖 About The Project
 
This project analyzes **Swiggy restaurant data** using SQL to derive actionable business insights.
 
The objective is to answer real-world business questions related to:
 
- Restaurant performance
- Cuisine popularity
- Customer engagement
- Revenue estimation
- Pricing strategies
- City-wise trends
 
