## 💻 Sample Query
 
```sql
WITH Revenue_CTE AS
(
SELECT
Name,
Cost * Rating_Count AS Revenue
FROM restaurants
)
 
SELECT *
FROM Revenue_CTE
ORDER BY Revenue DESC
LIMIT 10;
```
 
